  "content": "\n\n<p><strong>透明玻璃</strong>&nbsp;是重視透明度與無縫設計的建造玩家必備的材質包。此材質包移除了原版玻璃令人分心的邊框與視覺雜訊，為你帶來真正通透的窗戶。</p>\n<p><strong>注意：</strong>&nbsp;若要啟用連接玻璃效果，必須使用&nbsp;<strong>OptiFine</strong>&nbsp;或&nbsp;<strong>Continuity</strong>。</p>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbisecthosting.com%252fnikinok\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/partners/custom-banners/3f28919b-47a6-4026-8e56-0d52a13170bb.webp\" alt=\"替代文字\"></a></p>",
